---@class posthog.mcp_analytics.ListMcpAnalyticsSessionsRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field date_from? string Start of the window to aggregate sessions over. PostHog date string — relative (e.g. '-7d', '-24h') or an absolute ISO timestamp. Defaults to '-7d'.
---@field date_to? string End of the window. PostHog date string or absolute ISO timestamp. Defaults to now.
