---@class posthog.mcp_analytics.UpdateMcpAnalyticsCustomHarnessRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field id string A UUID string identifying this mcp custom harness.
---@field name string Name to show for calls from this harness.
---@field match_pattern string Text to look for in the client name or User-Agent product that the harness reports. Matching ignores case and finds the text anywhere in the name, so `acme-agent` matches `Acme-Agent/1.2`.
---@field icon? string Optional icon shown next to the harness name. A base64 data URI of a PNG, GIF or WebP image with a transparent background, 16 KB or smaller and at most 256 by 256 pixels. The icon shows in one color, like the built-in harness logos. An empty string means no icon.

---@class posthog.mcp_analytics.UpdateMcpAnalyticsCustomHarnessesPartialRequest
