---@field icon? string Optional icon shown next to the harness name. A base64 data URI of a PNG, GIF or WebP image with a transparent background, 16 KB or smaller and at most 256 by 256 pixels. The icon shows in one color, like the built-in harness logos. An empty string means no icon.

